     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hiwA-item\">\n      <div class=\"hiwA-badge\">5</div>\n      <div>\n        <h4 class=\"hiwA-title\">Supports Stress Response</h4>\n        <p class=\"hiwA-text\">Supports a healthy stress response and nervous system function. Helps maintain energy levels and emotional wellbeing.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hiwA-item\">\n      <div class=\"hiwA-badge\">6</div>\n      <div>\n        <h4 class=\"hiwA-title\">Supports Recovery &amp; Structural Health</h4>\n        <p class=\"hiwA-text\">Supports muscle function and recovery. Helps maintain joint health and skin structure. Provides antioxidant support.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
