        "review_Qecwhm": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I finally feel like I have my 'brain' back. Between the kids and work, I was always exhausted, but the adaptogens in this give me such a calm, steady energy. My skin looks more hydrated, too. It’s a bit pricey, but worth every cent for how I feel.”</p>",
