        },
        "review_EDmF7D": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“The best 'all-in-one' I’ve found. I’ve noticed a huge difference in my cycle-related breakouts and my hair feels much thicker after two months. I love that it has Vitamin D and Zinc already in there—one less thing to remember in the morning!”</p>",
            "name": "Leah M. (Brisbane, QLD)"
          }
        },
        "review_tM4fXk": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I was skeptical about the Shilajit for women, but the hormone balance is real. I feel less 'on edge' and my afternoon sugar cravings have actually disappeared. The Forest Fruit taste is lovely—I just mix it with water and head to the gym.”</p>",
            "name": "Emma R. (Sydney, NSW)"
          }
        },
        "review_t6GmRM": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I’m 52 and my skin was starting to look really dull. After three weeks of Ultra Performance, I have a genuine glow again. My nails are finally growing past my fingertips without breaking. It’s a premium product that actually lives up to the hype.”</p>",
            "name": "Janine K. (Perth, WA)"
          }
        }
